    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Fairlee, Vermont, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1973; field checked in 1975; photo inspected in 1983; last revised in 1981; printed in 1990.",
